@startuml feature-tiers
title Cargo feature tiers mapped to DDD layers (ADR-0013 + ADR-0014)
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

package "core (no allocator) — always compiles" #E8F4FF {
  component "time.rs\nminutes_between" as TIME
  component "slug.rs\nis_valid_slug" as SLUG
  component "voices catalog\nADHAN_VOICES · AdhanVoice" as VOICES
  component "error.rs\nMawaqitError (core variants)" as ERROR
}

package "alloc tier — default-features = false, features = [alloc]" #FFF6DD {
  component "models.rs (ConfData…)\ncalendar.rs · scraper.rs\nserde_json (optional dep)" as ALLOMD
  component "compact.rs::CompactCalendarBuilder\n.bin / .rs / .h emitters" as BUILDER
  component "voices::adhan_voice_url\nvoice_id_from_conf" as VOICESALLOC
}

package "heapless tier — features = [heapless]\nzero-alloc MCU firmware" #DDF0DD {
  component "compact.rs::CompactCalendarView\nCompactTime · CompactDayTimes\nCRC-32 (crc32fast, no_std)" as VIEW
}

package "std tier — default" #FFE1E1 {
  component "client.rs (reqwest/tokio)\ncache.rs · disk.rs\ndownload_voice · pack_for_mcu" as STDINFRA
}

TIME --> SLUG : shared policy
ALLOMD ..> TIME : uses
BUILDER ..> VIEW : same module, cfg-split
STDINFRA ..> ALLOMD
STDINFRA ..> VIEW : std enables heapless\n(ADR-0013 feature matrix)

note as N1
  Gate: just targets-mcu —
  {thumbv7em-none-eabihf, riscv32imc-unknown-none-elf, host}
  × {std, alloc, heapless} must all cargo-check clean.
  serde_json cannot compile without an allocator, so it is wired into
  the alloc feature — the heapless tier never links it.
end note
@enduml
